          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Bacii the Label (Bear & Roo Co Pty Ltd)<br/>Effective Date:</strong> May 2026<br/></p><h4><strong><br/>1. Overview</strong></h4><p>This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>Bacii the Label</strong> (“we”, “us”, “our”) collects, uses and discloses your personal information when you visit or make a purchase from our website.</p><p>We are committed to protecting your privacy and complying with the <strong>Privacy Act 1988 (Australia)</strong>.<br/><br/></p><p></p><h4><strong>2. Personal Information We Collect</strong></h4><h4></h4><h5><strong>Device & Usage Information</strong></h5><p>When you visit our website, we automatically collect:</p><ul><li>IP address</li><li>Browser type and device information</li><li>Time zone</li><li>Pages viewed, time spent, and referring websites</li></ul><p>This helps us understand how customers interact with our store and improve performance.</p><p></p><h5></h5><h5><strong>Order Information</strong></h5><p>When you make a purchase, we collect:</p><ul><li>Name</li><li>Billing and shipping address</li><li>Email address</li><li>Phone number</li><li>Payment details (processed securely via third-party providers — we do not store full card details)</li></ul><h5></h5><h5><strong>Marketing & Tracking Data</strong></h5><p>We use the following tools to understand behaviour and improve our marketing:</p><ul><li>Shopify (our ecommerce platform)</li><li>Klaviyo (email and SMS marketing)</li><li>Meta Pixel (Facebook & Instagram advertising)</li><li>Google Analytics</li></ul><p>These tools may collect data such as:</p><ul><li>Pages viewed</li><li>Products viewed</li><li>Add-to-cart activity</li><li>Purchases</li><li>Interactions with ads and emails</li></ul><h4></h4><h4></h4><h4><strong>3. How We Use Your Information</strong></h4><p>We use your personal information to:</p><ul><li>Process and fulfil orders</li><li>Provide shipping and delivery updates</li><li>Communicate with you (customer service, order confirmations)</li><li>Screen orders for fraud or risk</li><li>Improve our website, products and marketing</li><li>Send marketing emails and SMS (if you opt in)</li></ul><h4></h4><h4></h4><h4><strong>4. Sharing Your Information</strong></h4><p>We only share your information with trusted third parties necessary to operate our business, including:</p><ul><li>Shopify (store platform & checkout)</li><li>Payment providers (e.g. Shopify Payments, PayPal)</li><li>Shipping providers (e.g. Australia Post / MyPost Business)</li><li>Klaviyo (email/SMS marketing)</li><li>Advertising platforms (e.g. Meta, Google)</li></ul><p>We do not sell your personal information.</p><h4></h4><h4></h4><h4><strong>5. Cookies & Tracking Technologies</strong></h4><p>We use cookies and similar technologies to:</p><ul><li>Keep your cart active</li><li>Remember your preferences</li><li>Analyse site traffic</li><li>Deliver personalised advertising</li></ul><p>This includes tracking via Meta Pixel and Google Analytics.</p><p>You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings.</p><h4></h4><h4></h4><h4><strong>6. Marketing Communications</strong></h4><p>If you opt in, we may send you:</p><ul><li>Email marketing via Klaviyo</li><li>SMS marketing (if enabled)</li></ul><p>You can unsubscribe at any time by:</p><ul><li>Clicking “unsubscribe” in emails</li><li>Opting out of SMS</li><li>Contacting us directly</li></ul><h4></h4><h4></h4><h4><strong>7. Data Retention</strong></h4><p>We retain your personal information for as long as necessary to:</p><ul><li>Provide our services</li><li>Maintain business records</li><li>Comply with legal obligations</li></ul><h4></h4><h4></h4><h4><strong>8. Your Rights</strong></h4><p>Under Australian privacy law, you have the right to:</p><ul><li>Access the personal information we hold about you</li><li>Request corrections to your data</li><li>Request deletion of your personal information (where applicable)</li></ul><h4></h4><h4></h4><h4><strong>9. Security</strong></h4><p>We take reasonable steps to protect your personal information, including using secure platforms like Shopify and encrypted payment processing.</p><h4></h4><h4></h4><h4><strong>10. Children’s Privacy</strong></h4><p>Our products are designed for children, however our website is intended for use by adults (parents or guardians).<br/>We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children.</p><h4></h4><h4></h4><h4><strong>11. International Data Transfers</strong></h4><p>Some of our service providers (such as Shopify, Klaviyo, Meta, and Google Analytics) may store or process data outside Australia.</p><p>By using our website, you consent to this transfer.</p><h4></h4><h4></h4><h4><strong>12. Changes to This Policy</strong></h4><p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting on this page.</p><h4></h4><h4></h4><h4><strong>13. Contact Us</strong></h4><p>For more information about our privacy practices or if you have any questions, please contact us:</p><p>hello@baciithelabel.com</p>",
